  "text": "[warm] June seventeenth — a hinge you could miss. The prompts leave the code. Every seat's instructions move out of the workflow file into eight markdown cards; the file drops from six hundred lines to fewer than three hundred. [short pause] Why it matters: editing a card between cycles re-tunes the live loop. No relaunch. The loop became breedable. [pause] The steering channels arrived the same week: a writ that outranks everything; a sow console, so the roadmap is mutated only by code. The early re-tunings leaned one way — toward things you can touch. The rule the drawer learned still reads: a vivid caption can't lift an abstract chart. [short pause] This drawer opens twice more — higher in this cut, in a layer we haven't reached. Every values correction came from outside. Always re-weighted criteria. Never a mandate.",
